  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_01",
      "hash64": "17B1F5D2AF61C424",
      "text": "你终于来了！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_02",
      "hash64": "17B1F8D2AF61C93D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你昨天好厉害啊。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_03",
      "hash64": "17B1F7D2AF61C78A",
      "text": "夺回面具小队\\n今后就没有用武之地了吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_04",
      "hash64": "17B1F2D2AF61BF0B",
      "text": "阿栗他……\\n回家以后就一直\\r\\n窝在房间里。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_select_01",
      "hash64": "208FF08D9FE482EC",
      "text": "让人担心啊",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_select_02",
      "hash64": "208FF38D9FE48805",
      "text": "这样啊",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_05",
      "hash64": "17B1F1D2AF61BD58",
      "text": "嗯……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_06",
      "hash64": "17B1F4D2AF61C271",
      "text": "啊，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你也不用感到自责。\\c\\n本来就是我让你\\n把厄诡椪的事保密的……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_07",
      "hash64": "17B1F3D2AF61C0BE",
      "text": "阿栗他啊！其实\\n自尊心还挺～强的！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_08",
      "hash64": "17B1EED2AF61B83F",
      "text": "厄诡椪\\n它一切都好吗？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_09",
      "hash64": "17B1EDD2AF61B68C",
      "text": "我不是学阿栗，\\n但是我也变得\\r\\n特别喜欢厄诡椪了。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_10",
      "hash64": "17AEF0D2AF5F85CE",
      "text": "所以啊，让我跟你和\\n厄诡椪来场对战吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_11",
      "hash64": "17AEF1D2AF5F8781",
      "text": "刚见面时我故意找你茬，\\n你是不是记仇了？\\r\\n让我们留些好的回忆嘛，拜托啦～[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_12",
      "hash64": "17AEEED2AF5F8268",
      "text": "我就知道你会答应的！\\n这样才像你嘛！\\r\\n等你准备好了，就来告诉我吧！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_29",
      "hash64": "17AB71D2AF5C782A",
      "text": "看来你带着厄诡椪呢！\\n它的对战方式好像会随面具改变，\\r\\n要直接开始对战吗？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_30",
      "hash64": "17A7E4D2AF5952BC",
      "text": "先把厄诡椪带过来再说吧！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_31",
      "hash64": "17A7E5D2AF59546F",
      "text": "你的同行队伍和盒子里\\n到处都没有厄诡椪啊……\\r\\n算了……开始对战？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_32",
      "hash64": "17A7E6D2AF595622",
      "text": "等你想答应了，\\n就再来告诉我一声吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_13",
      "hash64": "17AEEFD2AF5F841B",
      "text": "那么，\\n来各就各位吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_14",
      "hash64": "17AEF4D2AF5F8C9A",
      "text": "好不甘心～！\\n但是！你果然很厉害～！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_15",
      "hash64": "17AEF5D2AF5F8E4D",
      "text": "你和厄诡椪\\n这么心意相通，\\r\\n我都要嫉妒了。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_33",
      "hash64": "17A7E7D2AF5957D5",
      "text": "其实我是想跟厄诡椪对战的，\\n但看来没办法啊。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_ogre_01",
      "hash64": "AAE0A16A70165E5D",
      "text": "啵尼哦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_16",
      "hash64": "17AEF2D2AF5F8934",
      "text": "虽然不太好开口，\\n但其实啊，\\r\\n我差不多……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_system_01",
      "hash64": "DFD413767C8D29C7",
      "text": "洛托洛托洛托洛托……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "A3032A72F30EB242",
      "text": "你好啊，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n我是白蕾雅。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "A3032972F30EB08F",
      "text": "今天早上，所有的小组\\n都完成了定向越野。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "A3032872F30EAEDC",
      "text": "管理员有话要说，\\n所以想让大家到公民馆前集合。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_25",
      "hash64": "17AB65D2AF5C63C6",
      "text": "我也知道啦～[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "A3032772F30EAD29",
      "text": "丹瑜也跟你在一起吗？\\n太好了，这样就省得我联系她了。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "A3032672F30EAB76",
      "text": "小孩子真是厉害，\\n在很短的时间内，\\r\\n就能一下子交上朋友呢。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "A3032572F30EA9C3",
      "text": "那我会和大家\\n在公民馆前等你们哦！[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_26",
      "hash64": "17AB64D2AF5C6213",
      "text": "她说的没错，\\n我们好不容易……\\r\\n才成为朋友。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_27",
      "hash64": "17AB63D2AF5C6060",
      "text": "那我们就去听听\\n管理员要说什么吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
